                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "SANCTION (first seen), UPDATED (status/decision changed since last run), TERMINATED (uspto_ptab only - the trial's terminationDate transitioned from unset to set since it was last seen, a more specific signal than a generic UPDATED), or SNAPSHOT_NO_DIFF (unchanged, re-emitted because onlyNew=false)"
                        },
                        "scraped_at": {
